  "note": "Lean's H has c₊ = 2 and δ₀ = 392 (scale-y arcs), i.e. Erratum: The constant -2.14938 = -2(log(3/8) + c+ - (8/15)c-) uses the 2013 values c+ = 2.3912, c- = 0.6294; with the book's c+ = 2.0532, c- = 0.6394 it is -1.46271, so at kappa = 49, x = 4.9*10^26 the jump is 0.476437 > 7/15 and Ch. 14's '<= 7/15' fails. (checked by `scripts/checks/eq_13_13.py`)."
